caption: Prestige Count and Cost
rule: prestige-count-and-cost

Prestige Count is the number of times a character has Prestiged.

Under the legacy Isekai preset, if P is the current Prestige Count:

Next Prestige cost = 1,000 × 2^P character points

A character may complete several Prestige levels at once if current character value can pay the accumulated cost of every level gained.

Cost from Prestige Count P to P + N = Σ from i = P to P + N - 1 of (1,000 × 2^i)
